<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have pulled back from the area around Bunia but have opened a new front near the Uganda border and are advancing toward Uvira city. WHO evacuated its Ebola response team from an Ituri hospital after fighting trapped them, and the Ebola death rate is now near 50% as cases surpass 12,000. Rebels claim to have shot down a Congolese military aircraft, which has gone missing, and a South African mercenary was captured in the aftermath. The conflict has displaced 8.2 million people and caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5uQzZ2Z05RVGJOSUNFUUc5MkFqWG01c2FkQjA0TllLdGY2cGc2MFplakYwWFVlcGFiWVlIdy1FWnAzVkJIejNtMk9FU0Z2QWhfUXFVSW9Qd2UwV1JiaGlKRjVVYi1qZ0NYOE1yT1BTRlNRdGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE00WmxwSV9jNXZtSUVOamNZTVhyTm9PS3lCZXYwZFdCaHMycmNFZVJDc3VfUHBNNHp2VVZNaHRUVGdTUzh1TFNKWk54Y2NRNTBZc296bVhjVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPcVg1dVY3Wm5lLS1uX3lwZmRPMlY3NV9oUldqb213MjV4OXRjeVF2dHQxYWRFbVg5MEZKbVZzd0JFVlAtQzRfcmZpeHUxallwcmxSblZBdGE1Q2s1MlFQUTZCSTdwNEJod3dyOU5sNFBqTXZwMTJhXzBWMXZyTnlubFFiZERhTWx6TTlRZXdnN0ItNExLVjFVTTRyWmx4Z2RDWTJGa3d1dVJUUTJIS01VSkxsWldwWnJFcHZTQXFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE05OTlucWtzV2luYk5iWlJMWVZpNXdDbTQxazd6SHpvazZMNl82bEN4VDNBQ0dtSzJvemN3cUxYOTJlT0t6dW96bndaLVdkQ2dVckZ4OFN3aGNjTFZXUEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQWDdrcllEUWhscEtTb1k0WGVQOGhsZGJGbjY5VS1IM004VUNlVnpheFlFNGFfU0pFZlg5TjRNRi1ib3IyVzNrRDBoczk2cWhtaTZvTX